# Models (large binaries — store separately)
# Exception: big-lama.pt is needed by the CI-built iOS benchmark
# (ios_bench/convert_models.py), tracked via Git LFS specifically for that.
# (Un-ignoring a file under an ignored directory requires un-ignoring the
# directory itself first -- a bare "!models/big-lama.pt" does not work.)
models/*
!models/big-lama.pt
*.task

